abstract: >-
  Forward development line of the MQGT-SCF program, carrying the corpus forward
  with the September 2026 verification repairs applied. The draft v2026.10.01 release
  stages the public edition of the 1 October 2026 research collection
  (7,399 pages): Baird / ZoraASI corpus Parts 1-4 with the 18 September 2026
  unified edition, plus Jennifer Lorraine Nielsen's independently authored
  gauge-gravity preprint (CC BY 4.0). Per-component rights are listed in
  editions/2026-10-01/NOTICE.md.
